<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33963" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>felt-shoe</i> or
			<i>slipper</i>, used by the Boeotians, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.195
			</span></i>; at Athens by old men, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				870
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nu.</u>
				858
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				103
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				275
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				447
			</span></i>,al.; by poor persons, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				5.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. Σικυωνία</span> a woman's
				<i>shoe of white felt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Rh.Pr.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὠμοβοεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόθορνος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Callix.
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				41
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Gall.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσαῖ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pseudol.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>part of the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελώνη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
